00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:43.920
they thought the eco well and waste-free phd and&nbsp;
they both said it looked like a pretty good idea

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:48.960
zero co is based on a closed-loop refill system&nbsp;
you buy their products which come in refillable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.600
pouches there's also optional forever bottles&nbsp;
which come in pretty millennial friendly pastel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:58.240
