00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:07.120
the reply paid mailing bag you need 15 to&nbsp;
make the carbon cost of mailing worth it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.480
zero co then clean and refill&nbsp;
the pouches for the next person

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.640
the dispensers are made from ocean beach and&nbsp;
landfill-bound waste there's a tracking code&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.160
